{"1689480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "乡间", "steam_appid": 1689480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/fd4ffa7a86a9ab8d150e46915c063f5a.poster.avif?t=1630261083\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/fd4ffa7a86a9ab8d150e46915c063f5a.webm?t=1630261083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/fd4ffa7a86a9ab8d150e46915c063f5a.mp4?t=1630261083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>这是一款以农村为背景的模拟经营游戏。建造农田、伐木场、采石场等建筑来生产基础资源，建造加工厂来生产利润更高的产品，在市场售卖产品获得利润，为村民升级房屋和工作场所增加幸福度，在乡政府解锁政策调控生产。最终目标是建立美丽新农村。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/9b0e18ee87ca69f61d34631f5b7d45e8.avif?t=1630261083\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>仓库建筑，可以显示全局库存。<br>市政建筑，可以研究选择政策。<br>市场，可以进行买卖交易。每周结束时进行一次交易结算。<br>民房，每周消耗1单位食物。会选择仓库里库存最多的食物。<br>矿场，特殊灰色地形上才能有产出。矿物丰度为0没有产出<br>渔港，需要沿岸2~3格的地方造一条平行的路，保证入口在岸上，渔船的一侧在水里。<br>伐木场，会砍伐倒周围的树木，如果周围没有成熟的树就不会有产出。<br>市场，所有市场共用一个交易面板。但是多个市场能有效缓解交通压力，因为车辆会去最近的市场。<br>工坊，可以加工基础资源产出利润更高的产品。升级后解锁更多的产品选择（如衣服，肉罐头，鱼罐头）。<br>养殖场，消耗粮食产出肉，升级后解锁毛皮。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/8376d054f259c26bfd808944ff7f1c50.poster.avif?t=1630261083\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/8376d054f259c26bfd808944ff7f1c50.webm?t=1630261083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689480/extras/8376d054f259c26bfd80